"sourceCharacterId":"c26827"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d18ae9c7dbbbdf4d9a362ce8e07af0a4738b6780e938cadea49e2a0043701b05.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48c6c5a5333256e490070c783959b8866caa8552773df8182cdaaed9c725b3a1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神無月 季","creatorId":"vndb:s1066","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1066","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1066","name":"神無月 季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:204","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26840","characterName":"少年","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26840"},"originalCharacterName":"少年","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ikumi's roommate and her observer, Shounen's true name was never revealed in the game. A mysterious young male, he lacks common sense regarding boy-girl relationships which Ikumi frowns upon. As a way of cheering her up, he would make up bedtime stories, find her a plushie doll, etc. although he is a bit clumsy in doing so. During critical times however, he would show up whenever Ikumi is in mortal danger."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It was later revealed that he is not a real human, but that of the \"demon\" race."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26840"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c137ddc27a9132e38d19a4266708e93744f04b5d9bec0d104e282b05e28ae51d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/6875aae0e01da4a680ebe658b93dd9f0115f5ac9